<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[84rem] items-center gap-14 px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-2" data-reveal>
      <p class="serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,3.4vw,3rem)] leading-none">Dear friends,</p>
      <div class="body-copy mt-8 max-w-[34rem] space-y-5 text-[1.125rem]">
        <p>We met on this island ten summers ago, over a rental bike with a bent basket, and we have wanted to go back ever since. There are no cars, the lilacs are out, and the Straits turn pink at nine at night. We couldn't think of a better place to say it in front of everyone we love.</p>
        <p>We've made it a whole weekend because getting there takes a little effort: a drive, a ferry, a porter for your bags. Come on Friday for fish by the harbor, stay for the wedding on Saturday, and have pancakes with us before the Sunday boats.</p>
        <p>One piece of advice before anything else: come in comfortable shoes. You will walk everywhere, and there is dancing on grass.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="script mt-10 text-[3.5rem] text-primary">Iris &amp; Callum</p>
